flowchart TD
    A([Start: Emergency Referral]) --> B[Get patient location and symptom description]
    B --> C{Symptoms match an<br/>emergency keyword?}
    C -->|No| D[Redirect to Book Appointment]
    C -->|Yes| E{Clinic with doctor on duty<br/>found within radius?}
    E -->|No — radius less than max| F[Increase search radius]
    F --> E
    E -->|Yes| G[Display urgent referral message<br/>and notify that clinic]
    E -->|No — max radius reached| H[Display: Contact district<br/>hospital hotline]
    D --> I([Log interaction and End])
    G --> I
    H --> I
